  "releaseNotes": "- Modified the configuration schema file to allow optional 'metadata' attribute to element 'string' for named constrictor/method parameters.\n\t\t\tThe value can be set to anythng to describe the value in attribute 'value'.\n\t\t\tExample:  <string value=\"c:/Files/MyFile.json\"   metadata=\"path\"/>.\n\t\t\tIn this example an application can use an instance of IoC.Configuration.AttributeValueTransformer.IAttributeValueTransformer\n\t\t\tto transform the value to replace occurrences of '/' with path separator for an operating system ('\\' for windows, and '/' for unix).\n\t\t\t- Removed loadAllways from schema. This attribute was not used since 2022 and a warning was logged about that fact before.\n\t\t\t- Referencing newer version of OROptimizer.Shared",
